  "body": "This adds an early return for window.{alert,confirm,prompt} when triggered from a different origin-domain iframe.\nImplementation for this change is in progress both in Chrome and Firefox, and was supported by Webkit (see \ndiscussion on issue #5407)\n\nChecklist:\n* [x]  At least two implementers are interested (and none opposed):\n  * Chrome: https://groups.google.com/a/chromium.org/d/msg/blink-dev/hTOXiBj3D6A/JtkdpDd1BAAJ\n  * Firefox: https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1624978\n* [x]  [Tests](https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt) are written and can be reviewed and commented upon at:\n  * https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/27435\n* [x]  [Implementation bugs](https://github.com/whatwg/meta/blob/main/MAINTAINERS.md#handling-pull-requests) are filed:\n  * Chrome: https://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=1065085\n  * Firefox: https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1624978\n  * Safari: https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=221568\n\n\n<!--\n    This comment and the below content is programatically generated.\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\n\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\n    and remove what's below.\n-->\n***\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/6297/acknowledgements.html\" title=\"Last updated on Feb 8, 2021, 8:41 PM UTC (26412c5)\">/acknowledgements.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/6297/ecd23cf...26412c5/acknowledgements.html\" title=\"Last updated on Feb 8, 2021, 8:41 PM UTC (26412c5)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/6297/timers-and-user-prompts.html\" title=\"Last updated on Feb 8, 2021, 8:41 PM UTC (26412c5)\">/timers-and-user-prompts.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/6297/ecd23cf...26412c5/timers-